before:
This server example assigns a header before sending a known public response.
```javascript
res.set("Cache-Control", "public, max-age=60");
res.json({title: "Public catalog"});
```

after:
```javascript
function cachePolicy(scope) {
  return scope === "public-catalog" ? "public, max-age=60" : "no-store";
}
console.log(cachePolicy("public-catalog"));
console.log(cachePolicy("account"));
```
This prints public, max-age=60, then no-store.
